#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:70
#: 23821a967fea4c188d6a5c4f38e3f1e3
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:72
#: 51d75f6fa6e84108badca1861c9ec4be
msgid "RC input is configured on the R3 (UART3_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:74
#: 0e6e4f72053c44af9b1e7feb4e95cbe8
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:76
#: 96cce638d5434587b7de63bd2de76dfd
msgid "SBUS FPort requires connection to T3 and an external bi-directional inverter, see :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:78
#: a6722609442844878906169cb9d21558
msgid "CRSF also requires a T3 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:80
#: ef6f06cd8d5c41d7820b511b74ec1bf2
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to R3 and T3 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:82
#: 7f8223961d9c425cb8096df2aaae238e
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:85
#: 35c7fb4e289b4aa88f92d9966f1e78fe
msgid "ESC Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:87
#: cf2413f668e24e2a870b12cc32057e41
msgid "The SERIAL5 port (UART5) is for ESC telemetry. It is connected through the motor connector and works out of the box with the `Tekko32 F3 Mini <https://shop.holybro.com/tekko32-f3-4in1-45a-mini-esc_p1132.html>`__ which is commonly paired with this autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:90
#: e98fc3a30ef545dd9f664b2b7adb3b62
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:92
#: 4a21b8b328ba46a18f9eff9f8c56c872
msgid "FrSky Telemetry is supported using the SmartPort pad (UART1). You need to set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT. It has built-in inverters and a diode to allow for operation from a single pin with no special adapters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:97
#: 71632ceb927043bcb39e044bb0250534
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 4 or 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:98
#: 8e1253b89962441fb035d6fe4de62d02
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:101
#: 72f8d782b36e467eaad12e3d8f0ee1ed
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:103
#: e8dfece10032448ea49f19acbb943810
msgid "The KakuteF4 supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:106
#: 6eaa4f73d20a441eb60e841b7f1ca992
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:108
#: 98875bc425cb4036923eb605d470eaa8
msgid "The KakuteF4 supports up to 5 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to M6 on the above diagram are for the 5 outputs. M1-4 outputs support DShot and :ref:`Bi-Directional DShot<bidir-dshot>`, as well as all PWM types. The M5 is defaulted to support serial LEDs instead of PWM but can be changed by changing its default function using :ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` and supports Dshot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:112
#: 2fe9343b3a484af3bd493ba2c4c55716
msgid "The PWM is in 2 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:114
#: 4256e69c38454f90afdd750bfeb1fa9a
msgid "PWM 1 and 2 in group 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:115
#: ad905080d9c04c828e1d154ad35955f2
msgid "PWM 3 and 4 in group 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:116
#: 6a072601c8374d9eaffd6f527bdfe67c
msgid "PWM 5 in group 3 (defaulted as serial LED)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:118
#: 244224fa4a234967ba68dce5e1f9faf1
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

